520/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1724071695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1646520/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1724071695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Clock Overwhelmed is a game that brings criticism to modern times, in which you have more and more tasks to do and you have to solve a real puzzle to try to fit all your activities.<br><br>Shoot all tasks in the blank spaces of your watch,<br>without overlapping any activity!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2>  <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 30 carefully designed levels;<br></li><li> Original soundtrack composed especially to help you stay immersed in the game;<br></li><li> Addictive gameplay, perfect for those looking for casual action games;<br></li><li> Beautiful Lowpoly art style.</li></ul>",
